:''For other uses see [[Balrog (disambiguation)]].''
'''Balrog Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsules]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 577
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Balrog Cat
|name2 = Balrog Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Balrog Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This cat isn't really good due to single target, low HP and long recharge time for a cheap unit. Its only strength is the high DPS, which is hindered by his low health and long recharge time. Overall, this unit is not viable unless in early game.

